      "cooked": "<p>Now that the Void Guard is out, I wanted to see all the different nemesis dialogue variations for them and La Capitan. So, here they are! (As the Void Guard variants are revealed, I'll add them here)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Normal:</p>\n<p>La Capitan: \"Ahoy, Niños! Have over all of your valuables, or be thrown overboard!\"</p>\n<p>Sentinels: \"We stand as one! We fight together! And we oppose your evil ways!\"</p>\n<p>Adamant Sentinels: \"Everyone, into Alpha Formation! Just like we practiced! We're ready for this.\"</p>\n<p>Dr. Medico: \"Heads up, heroes! Dr. Medico is on call!\"</p>\n<p>Mainstay: \"We got ourselves a little a [sic] learnin' opportunity here. Welcome to the School of Hard Knocks!\"</p>\n<p>Idealist: \"If we beat up the villain quick, will we have time to get ice cream?\"</p>\n<p>Writhe: \"Hush. The shadows have some silence they want you to hear.\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Nemesis:</p>\n<p>Vs Sentinels:</p>\n<p>LC: \"And so we meet again! Or is this the first time? It is hard to know. But it shall be the last time!\"</p>\n<p>S: \"Once again, the time-travelling ne'er-do-well! You're going to jail this time!\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Vs. Adamant Sentinels:</p>\n<p>LC: \"You can withstand the seas of time, landlubbers! The time-turbulence has you looking rather green!\"</p>\n<p>AS: \"Ha, ha, very funny. Is there not a timeline in which you learn better jokes?\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Vs. Dr. Medico:</p>\n<p>LC: \"Si, my crew could always use a Medico, glowing one. First, your defeat. Then, you shall join my crew!\"</p>\n<p>DM: \"Great, now I have to sterilize the area. We don't want any bystanders picking up 17th Century diseases!\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Vs. Idealist:</p>\n<p>LC: \"La Pequeña Centinela! Have we met before? Do you remember who I am?\" (Note, it should be Centinela Pequeña, because Spanish, but whatever)</p>\n<p>I: \"Look out, it's Maria Helena Teresa Fafila Blah Blah Blah de Falcon, and she's being condescending!\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Vs. Mainstay:</p>\n<p>LC: \"Quieres Bailar, Mainstay? I know how much you enjoy my unexpected visits!\"</p>\n<p>M: \"We've done this dance before, darlin'. Can't say it'll work out any better for you this time.\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Vs. Writhe:</p>\n<p>LC: \"To ride the shadows themselves... Think of the potential bounty to be had with such power...\"</p>\n<p>W: \"You want my cloak? Take it. All you have to do is reach inside...\"</p>",
