      "created_at": "2018-10-17T06:22:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Braithwhite\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/48/1854_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Braithwhite:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The V style villains also now have individual dialog with their nemeses, their &nbsp;heroic versions, AND any former nemeses they might have (so v style Plague Rat has special lines for Chrono-Ranger, for instance).&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oddly Plague&nbsp;Rat and La Capitan seem to be the only team villains that got new dialogue, I just checked (Villains of the Multiverse) Miss Information and Ambuscade with Haka and Parse but nothing has changed there. Maybe it’s a special case with the two that do have new interactions? That or maybe there are plans to add more to the other two, but they weren’t ready in time for this update.</p>",
