      "created_at": "2018-10-17T23:30:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>(v) style la capitan? She does. It’s:</p>\n<p>La Capitan: “La Capitan? Eso&nbsp;me gusta!”</p>\n<p>Sentinels: “La Capitan! Spread out and watch for her crew...strange that we haven’t seen any sign of them yet.”</p>\n<p>and for the Adamant Sentinels:</p>\n<p>La Capitan: “Finally! I know you, you know me. Let’s dispense with the introductions then, si?”</p>\n<p>Adamant Sentinels: “We beat her when she was stronger, right? Let’s send her younger self back to the timestream!”</p>",
